  "description": "Taerang and Junhee's 7-year connection started as friends and eventually became a situationship. Now, although Taerang is certain they like each other, there's been zero development in their relationship. Frustrated by Junhee's passive attitude, he proactively attempts a kiss but instantly gets a nosebleed. “Now of all times?!” He hates that his nose bleeds so easily, but Junhee's reaction is unexpected… Taerang lowers his head at what he thought was Junhee’s clear agitation, only to be greeted by Junhee’s massive erection. Stunned only for a moment, Taerang quickly realizes he can use this to his advantage. Thankful that Junhee has a nosebleed fetish, and determined to push forward their relationship, he starts hitting on Junhee every time his nose drips with blood.\nSource: MU",
